title: SignaVis
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jairus
    family-names: Behrisch
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-3083-1248"
abstract: >-
  Interactive waveform + spectrogram audio player for bioacoustic analysis,
  annotation, and embeddable previews (Web, Streamlit, Gradio), with BirdNET
  detection support and Xeno-canto integration.
version: 1.1.3
date-released: "2026-11-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LimitlessGreen/SignaVis"
url: "https://limitlessgreen.github.io/SignaVis/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
